Read `README.md`, then `AGENTS.md`. It is the canonical policy for every AI tool: content rules
(no client or product names in cases, claims only the CV supports), technical rules (static Astro,
strict CSP, no inlined scripts or styles, one Lambda per route) and the deploy rule (master deploys
automatically; never push or run CDK without an explicit instruction). Module-specific notes live in
`.claude/rules/`. Do not duplicate or override these rules in tool-specific files.
